      "source_target_commitish": "main",
      "original_body": "Raw-bundle release archive for M2 issue #3 closure.\n\nVerdict (fixed): `stop_mechanism_direction` — the three-action controller did not beat the best fixed policy (`always_full_reuse`) in any matched round; results are recorded as negative and no per-workload retuning or post-hoc workload search is continued.\n\nContents: 39 reviewable raw-bundle lifecycles (main matrix 18 + candidate pilot 6 + anchor pilot 6 + anchor confirmation 9), identical to the directories checked into `paper/kv_materialization_control/experiments/results/`.\n\nEvidence boundary (kept at 39/102): the remaining 102 M2 lifecycles are aggregate-only supporting evidence; their raw bundles lived in /tmp on the execution machine and are no longer retrievable. This release does NOT restore the 141-lifecycle per-request-review claim.\n\nAsset: `m2_raw_bundles_39_lifecycles.tar.gz` (11 MB)\nSHA-256: `56803f152b19e7f30aba6195bacba25eb2adb1de9db9e42369752ccb9fae37c4`\n\nNote: the repository is currently private; this release URL becomes publicly fetchable once the repository/release is made public by an org admin.",
